      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The sales quote  was very punctual, they arrived the day after the initial contact call was made, viewed the power bill and were very informative on what we would save and the total cost of the system. The sales person was well versed in all details regarding solar.Because they were to busy to do the install in december  they kept the price at 2019 level with the rebate at 2019 level.The install was done as their first job for 2020, they arrived at 0800 and it was completed by their own staff by 3pm all up and working.The installers were polite ,informative and very tidy there was no mess left behind.I was very impressed with the customer service,the staff knew what they were doing and nothing was too much trouble. They organised the grid connection and informed us of all that was required to get connected to the grid.I very impressed with the service and would recomend this company to anyone wishing to have Solar installed.",
